            desc = "r006 field ParaWd. PROVEN 2026-11-11 (40 board runs): the number of software bits of the PARA part MINUS 1 (the hardware emits ParaWd+1 bits from SLCHDRSTRM0-3, right-aligned); vendor stores count-1 (H264eWrHWSlcHdr 0x57f4). Capacity 128 bits (7-bit field), vendor check count <= 128. Example IDR I slice: 8 (9 bits).";
